WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:10.262
The platform area is for the people who run Guildwise HQ itself. A platform administrator signs in with two-factor login and sees this separate menu.

2
00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:17.367
Organizations lists every organization on this server, with its status. You see metadata, never their work.

3
00:00:18.071 --> 00:00:23.212
Open one for its overview, its plan, limits and features, and its recent activity.

4
00:00:23.915 --> 00:00:32.192
Invitations starts a new organization: enter the owner’s email and the organization name, and they become its Owner when they accept.

5
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.484
Accounts lists everyone with an account, in every organization.

6
00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:42.733
API keys are for the agent API. A key is stored hashed, and shown only once.

7
00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:49.641
Runners shows the runner version this server offers. Workstations check once a day and update themselves.

8
00:00:50.344 --> 00:00:59.837
Platform team names the organization that fixes Guildwise itself. And Inbound mail sets up the provider for the mail that organizations receive.

9
00:01:00.542 --> 00:01:05.811
Finally, the Audit log records every platform administrator action, and is kept forever.

10
00:01:06.512 --> 00:01:14.149
That is the platform area: organizations, accounts and the running system, kept apart from the work of each organization.
